# Synchronization
# ======================
# Synchronization is a technique to sync the selenium execution speed & web page loading speed i.e. managing the mismatch in speeds.
# The problem raises mainly while navigating from one page to another page, pop-us & alerts etc...
# This technique deal with usuage of waits for managing the selenium execution speed not the application speed to tackle the issue.
# The following are the synchronization techniques i.e. set selenium speed, sleep, set selenium timeout, implicit wait & explicit wait.

Note
=========
- page load timeout by default is 5mins & it can be altered by using 'set selenium page load timeout'